1. Purpose
The purpose of the Journal Posting module is to facilitate the manual entry, validation, authorization, and tracking of General Ledger (GL) transactions within the Fincore system. It implements a "Maker-Checker" workflow where users can create batches of transactions (Journal Posting), authorize requests created by others (Journal Authorization), and track the status of their own submissions (Journal Status).
2. Scope
This functionality covers the User Interface (UI) and Backend logic for:
 * Journal Creation: creating multi-row GL entries with strict debit/credit balancing validation.
 * Journal Authorization: Reviewing, approving, or rejecting pending batches (Bulk or Partial).
 * Journal Status: Tracking the lifecycle of submitted requests and cancelling pending requests.
